terialTitle":"詩經注析","contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","publicationYear":1991,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"题解","sourceLabel":"第 65 页","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"题解","excerpt":"程、蒋将《雄雉》解释为妇女思念久役丈夫之诗。题解虽提到方玉润曾改作朋友互勉之说，但认为前三章的思念语气和“钟惺评曰：百尔君子，非妇人语”之类并不足推翻旧解，末章不过是思妇对丈夫的规诫与祝愿。","fullText":"程、蒋将《雄雉》解释为妇女思念久役丈夫之诗。题解虽提到方玉润曾改作朋友互勉之说，但认为前三章的思念语气和“钟惺评曰：百尔君子，非妇人语”之类并不足推翻旧解，末章不过是思妇对丈夫的规诫与祝愿。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":[]},{"id":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi:0002-1:part-1","annotationId":"0002","glossId":"0002-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0002-1","materialId":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","materialTitle":"詩經注析","contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","publicationYear":1991,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"雄雉于飞，泄泄其羽。我之怀矣，自诒伊阻。","sourceLabel":"第 65 页","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"注析","excerpt":"程、蒋释“泄泄”为飞貌舒缓自得，“伊”为是，“阻”为隔。首章借雄雉高飞自得起兴，反衬所怀之人远役在外，而其远离之苦又像是他自己求取功名所致。","fullText":"程、蒋释“泄泄”为飞貌舒缓自得，“伊”为是，“阻”为隔。首章借雄雉高飞自得起兴，反衬所怀之人远役在外，而其远离之苦又像是他自己求取功名所致。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-001","seg-002","seg-003","seg-004"]},{"id":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi:0003-1:part-1","annotationId":"0003","glossId":"0003-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0003-1","materialId":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","materialTitle":"詩經注析","contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","publicationYear":1991,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"雄雉于飞，下上其音。展矣君子，实劳我心。","sourceLabel":"第 65-66 页","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"注析","excerpt":"程、蒋释“下上其音”为鸣声往复，“展”为诚。此章由见雉闻声转入对所怀君子的诚念，点出“实劳我心”，将思念从景物兴发推进为直接抒情。","fullText":"程、蒋释“下上其音”为鸣声往复，“展”为诚。此章由见雉闻声转入对所怀君子的诚念，点出“实劳我心”，将思念从景物兴发推进为直接抒情。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-005","seg-006","seg-007","seg-008"]},{"id":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi:0004-1:part-1","annotationId":"0004","glossId":"0004-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0004-1","materialId":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","materialTitle":"詩經注析","contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","publicationYear":1991,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"瞻彼日月，悠悠我思。道之云远，曷云能来？","sourceLabel":"第 66 页","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"注析","excerpt":"在程、蒋看来，第三章写得最为直露：望日月而知岁月空过，思念绵邈不绝；又因道路遥远而发“曷云能来”之叹，把久役难归的现实推到眼前。","fullText":"在程、蒋看来，第三章写得最为直露：望日月而知岁月空过，思念绵邈不绝；又因道路遥远而发“曷云能来”之叹，把久役难归的现实推到眼前。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-009","seg-010","seg-011","seg-012"]},{"id":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi:0005-1:part-1","annotationId":"0005","glossId":"0005-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0005-1","materialId":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","materialTitle":"詩經注析","contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","publicationYear":1991,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"百尔君子，不知德行。不忮不求，何用不臧？","sourceLabel":"第 66 页","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"注析","excerpt":"程、蒋将末章看作思妇对丈夫的劝勉与宽慰：只要不忮害、不贪求，自可保身全德，不必以仕进逐名。章末虽像议论，却正是前面忧思的反折。","fullText":"程、蒋将末章看作思妇对丈夫的劝勉与宽慰：只要不忮害、不贪求，自可保身全德，不必以仕进逐名。章末虽像议论，却正是前面忧思的反折。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-013","seg-014","seg-015","seg-016"]},{"id":"chenhuan-chuanshu:0001-1:part-1","annotationId":"0001","glossId":"0001-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/chenhuan-chuanshu/0001-1","materialId":"chenhuan-chuanshu","materialTitle":"詩毛氏傳疏","contributorLine":"清 · 陳奐","publicationYear":1847,"layer":"preface","layerLabel":"篇序","targetText":"雄雉刺衛宣公也淫亂不恤國事軍旅數起大夫久役男女怨曠國人患之而作是詩","sourceLabel":"第 54 页","attributionLabel":"诗序","sectionLabel":"序","excerpt":"序：《雄雉》，刺衛宣公也。淫亂不恤國事，軍旅數起，大夫久役，男女怨曠，國人患之而作是詩。","fullText":"序：《雄雉》，刺衛宣公也。淫亂不恤國事，軍旅數起，大夫久役，男女怨曠，國人患之而作是詩。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":[]},{"id":"chenhuan-chuanshu:0002-1:part-1","annotationId":"0002","glossId":"0002-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/chenhuan-chuanshu/0002-1","materialId":"chenhuan-chuanshu","materialTitle":"詩毛氏傳疏","contributorLine":"清 · 陳奐","publicationYear":1847,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"雄雉于飛，泄泄其羽。我之懷矣，自貽伊阻。雄雉于飛，下上其音。展矣君子，實勞我心。瞻彼日月，悠悠我思。道之云遠，曷云能來。百爾君子，不知德行。不忮不求，何用不臧。","sourceLabel":"第 54-55 页","attributionLabel":"陈奂","sectionLabel":"疏","excerpt":"陈奂疏《雄雉》时基本遵《序》刺宣公说，兼采《正义》以上二章为男旷、下二章为女怨的解释。其疏一方面从军旅久役引出男女怨旷，一方面又指出末章借“百尔君子”规劝德行，故不止怨而已。","fullText":"陈奂疏《雄雉》时基本遵《序》刺宣公说，兼采《正义》以上二章为男旷、下二章为女怨的解释。其疏一方面从军旅久役引出男女怨旷，一方面又指出末章借“百尔君子”规劝德行，故不止怨而已。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-001","seg-002","seg-003","seg-004","seg-005","seg-006","seg-007","seg-008","seg-009","seg-010","seg-011","seg-012","seg-013","seg-014","seg-015","seg-016"]},{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi:0001-1:part-1","annotationId":"0001","glossId":"0001-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/fangyurun-yuanshi/0001-1","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi","materialTitle":"诗经原始(上下)","contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","publicationYear":1986,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"雄雉㊟期友不歸，思以共勖也。","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"题注","excerpt":"方玉润在题注中径定《雄雉》为“期友不归，思以共勖”之诗，明白反对把它读成妇人思夫作。","fullText":"方玉润在题注中径定《雄雉》为“期友不归，思以共勖”之诗，明白反对把它读成妇人思夫作。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":[]},{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi:0002-1:part-1","annotationId":"0002","glossId":"0002-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/fangyurun-yuanshi/0002-1","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi","materialTitle":"诗经原始(上下)","contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","publicationYear":1986,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"总评","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评","excerpt":"方玉润总评中细驳《小序》刺宣公、《集传》妇人思夫两说，认为上三章皆可通于友朋相望，而末章“百爾君子”尤非妇人口吻。依他看，诗中“雄雉”只是比丈夫之有志高骞、欲显名当世者，末章则回到友朋规勉：与其远适他邦求誉，不如反求诸身、修德立行。","fullText":"方玉润总评中细驳《小序》刺宣公、《集传》妇人思夫两说，认为上三章皆可通于友朋相望，而末章“百爾君子”尤非妇人口吻。依他看，诗中“雄雉”只是比丈夫之有志高骞、欲显名当世者，末章则回到友朋规勉：与其远适他邦求誉，不如反求诸身、修德立行。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":[]},{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi:0003-1:part-1","annotationId":"0003","glossId":"0003-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/fangyurun-yuanshi/0003-1","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi","materialTitle":"诗经原始(上下)","contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","publicationYear":1986,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"眉评","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"眉评","excerpt":"方玉润眉评分章撮要：首章言远行乃自取，次章言怀想之至，三章言难来之故，末章则归结为自勉，以见全篇本是共勖之词。","fullText":"方玉润眉评分章撮要：首章言远行乃自取，次章言怀想之至，三章言难来之故，末章则归结为自勉，以见全篇本是共勖之词。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":[]},{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi:0004-1:part-1","annotationId":"0004","glossId":"0004-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/fangyurun-yuanshi/0004-1","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi","materialTitle":"诗经原始(上下)","contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","publicationYear":1986,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"雄雉于飛泄泄其羽自貽伊阻下上其音展矣君子不知德行不忮不求何用不臧","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集释","excerpt":"方玉润集释云：雉为有冠长尾、可用为仪之鸟；“泄泄”为自得，“阻”为隔，“展”为诚，“忮”为害，“求”为贪，“臧”为善。整组训诂都服从他把全篇读成高飞远适之友自取阻隔、而后反以修德自勉的思路。","fullText":"方玉润集释云：雉为有冠长尾、可用为仪之鸟；“泄泄”为自得，“阻”为隔，“展”为诚，“忮”为害，“求”为贪，“臧”为善。整组训诂都服从他把全篇读成高飞远适之友自取阻隔、而后反以修德自勉的思路。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-001","seg-002","seg-004","seg-006","seg-007","seg-014","seg-015","seg-016"]},{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi:0005-1:part-1","annotationId":"0005","glossId":"0005-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/fangyurun-yuanshi/0005-1","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi","materialTitle":"诗经原始(上下)","contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","publicationYear":1986,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"标韵","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"标韵","excerpt":"方玉润标出《雄雉》四章韵脚：首章“羽、阻”通韵，第二章“音、心”本韵，第三章“思、來”通韵，第四章“行、臧”本韵。每章一收，与其起兴转意的章法完全一致。","fullText":"方玉润标出《雄雉》四章韵脚：首章“羽、阻”通韵，第二章“音、心”本韵，第三章“思、來”通韵，第四章“行、臧”本韵。每章一收，与其起兴转意的章法完全一致。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":[]},{"id":"maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004:0001-1:part-1","annotationId":"0001","glossId":"0001-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/0001-1","materialId":"maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004","materialTitle":"毛詩注疏","contributorLine":"漢唐 · 毛亨、鄭氏、孔穎達","publicationYear":653,"layer":"preface","layerLabel":"篇序","targetText":"雄雉刺衛宣公也淫亂不恤國事軍旅數起大夫久役男女怨曠國人患之而作是詩","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"诗序","sectionLabel":"序","excerpt":"序：《雄雉》，刺衛宣公也。淫亂不恤國事，軍旅數起，大夫久役，男女怨曠，國人患之而作是詩。","fullText":"序：《雄雉》，刺衛宣公也。淫亂不恤國事，軍旅數起，大夫久役，男女怨曠，國人患之而作是詩。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":[]},{"id":"maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004:0002-1:part-1","annotationId":"0002","glossId":"0002-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/0002-1","materialId":"maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004","materialTitle":"毛詩注疏","contributorLine":"漢唐 · 毛亨、鄭氏、孔穎達","publicationYear":653,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"雄雉於飛泄泄其羽我之懷矣自詒伊阻","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"毛传","sectionLabel":null,"excerpt":"傳：雄雉見雌雉飛，而鼓其翼泄泄然。","fullText":"傳：雄雉見雌雉飛，而鼓其翼泄泄然。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-001","seg-002","seg-003","seg-004"]},{"id":"maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004:0003-1:part-1","annotationId":"0003","glossId":"0003-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/0003-1","materialId":"maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004","materialTitle":"毛詩注疏","contributorLine":"漢唐 · 毛亨、鄭氏、孔穎達","publicationYear":653,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"雄雉於飛下上其音展矣君子實勞我心","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"毛传","sectionLabel":null,"excerpt":"傳：展，誠也。","fullText":"傳：展，誠也。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-005","seg-006","seg-007","seg-008"]},{"id":"maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004:0004-1:part-1","annotationId":"0004","glossId":"0004-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/0004-1","materialId":"maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004","materialTitle":"毛詩注疏","contributorLine":"漢唐 · 毛亨、鄭氏、孔穎達","publicationYear":653,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"瞻彼日月悠悠我思道之云遠曷云能來","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"毛传","sectionLabel":null,"excerpt":"傳：瞻，視也。","fullText":"傳：瞻，視也。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-009","seg-010","seg-011","seg-012"]},{"id":"maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004:0005-1:part-1","annotationId":"0005","glossId":"0005-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/0005-1","materialId":"maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004","materialTitle":"毛詩注疏","contributorLine":"漢唐 · 毛亨、鄭氏、孔穎達","publicationYear":653,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"百爾君子不知德行不忮不求何用不臧","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"毛传","sectionLabel":null,"excerpt":"傳：忮，害。臧，善也。","fullText":"傳：忮，害。臧，善也。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-013","seg-014","seg-015","seg-016"]},{"id":"maruichen-tongshi:0001-1:part-1","annotationId":"0001","glossId":"0001-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/maruichen-tongshi/0001-1","materialId":"maruichen-tongshi","materialTitle":"毛詩傳箋通釋","contributorLine":"清 · 馬瑞辰","publicationYear":1989,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"雄雉于飛，泄泄其羽。我之懷矣，自貽伊阻。雄雉于飛，下上其音。展矣君子，實勞我心。瞻彼日月，悠悠我思。道之云遠，曷云能來。百爾君子，不知德行。不忮不求，何用不臧。","sourceLabel":"第 60-61 页","attributionLabel":"马瑞辰","sectionLabel":"按","excerpt":"马瑞辰论《雄雉》时，综采毛、郑、三家及《左传》引诗，详辨“詒”“伊”“展”“忮”“求”等训诂，并对“下上其音”“百尔君子”多所申说。其按语特别强调末章非泛作空论，而是由怀人怨役转入劝勉修德的题旨收束。","fullText":"马瑞辰论《雄雉》时，综采毛、郑、三家及《左传》引诗，详辨“詒”“伊”“展”“忮”“求”等训诂，并对“下上其音”“百尔君子”多所申说。其按语特别强调末章非泛作空论，而是由怀人怨役转入劝勉修德的题旨收束。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-001","seg-002","seg-003","seg-004","seg-005","seg-006","seg-007","seg-008","seg-009","seg-010","seg-011","seg-012","seg-013","seg-014","seg-015","seg-016"]},{"id":"quwanli-quanshi:0001-1:part-1","annotationId":"0001","glossId":"0001-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/quwanli-quanshi/0001-1","materialId":"quwanli-quanshi","materialTitle":"詩經詮釋","contributorLine":"现代 · 屈萬里","publicationYear":1983,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"全篇旨意","sourceLabel":"第 38-39 页","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注释","excerpt":"屈万里在首注中将《雄雉》概括为“此疑宣吁放泆，其妻念之，而作是诗”，基本仍承妇人思夫之解。全篇词注不作过多申说，但通过逐语解释把诗意落在怀人、忧思与末章规劝之上。","fullText":"屈万里在首注中将《雄雉》概括为“此疑宣吁放泆，其妻念之，而作是诗”，基本仍承妇人思夫之解。全篇词注不作过多申说，但通过逐语解释把诗意落在怀人、忧思与末章规劝之上。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":[]},{"id":"quwanli-quanshi:0002-1:part-1","annotationId":"0002","glossId":"0002-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/quwanli-quanshi/0002-1","materialId":"quwanli-quanshi","materialTitle":"詩經詮釋","contributorLine":"现代 · 屈萬里","publicationYear":1983,"layer":"term","layerLabel":"字词注","targetText":"雄雉于飛泄泄其羽自貽伊阻下上其音展矣君子曷云能來百爾君子不知德行不忮不求何用不臧","sourceLabel":"第 38-39 页","attributionLabel":"屈万里","sectionLabel":"注释","excerpt":"屈万里释“泄泄”为鼓翼缓飞貌，“詒”为遗，“伊”为是，“阻”为比，“展”为诚，“曷”为何时，“百爾”为凡爾，“不知德行”是反问语辞，“忮”为害，“求”为贪，“臧”为善。词义安排显示末章仍是以德行相勉的收束。","fullText":"屈万里释“泄泄”为鼓翼缓飞貌，“詒”为遗，“伊”为是，“阻”为比，“展”为诚，“曷”为何时，“百爾”为凡爾，“不知德行”是反问语辞，“忮”为害，“求”为贪，“臧”为善。词义安排显示末章仍是以德行相勉的收束。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-001","seg-002","seg-004","seg-006","seg-007","seg-012","seg-013","seg-014","seg-015","seg-016"]},{"id":"wangli-yundu:0001-1:part-1","annotationId":"0001","glossId":"0001-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/wangli-yundu/0001-1","materialId":"wangli-yundu","materialTitle":"詩經韻讀","contributorLine":"现代 · 王力","publicationYear":1980,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"《雄雉》韵读总说","sourceLabel":"第 154-155 页","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","excerpt":"王力将《雄雉》四章分作四组韵：首章“羽(hiua)、阻(tzia)”入鱼部，第二章“音(iəm)、心(siəm)”入侵部，第三章“思(sia)、来(lə)”入之部，第四章“行(heang)、臧(tsang)”入阳部。全诗每章一换韵，转折非常整齐。","fullText":"王力将《雄雉》四章分作四组韵：首章“羽(hiua)、阻(tzia)”入鱼部，第二章“音(iəm)、心(siəm)”入侵部，第三章“思(sia)、来(lə)”入之部，第四章“行(heang)、臧(tsang)”入阳部。全诗每章一换韵，转折非常整齐。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":[]},{"id":"wangli-yundu:0002-1:part-1","annotationId":"0002","glossId":"0002-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/wangli-yundu/0002-1","materialId":"wangli-yundu","materialTitle":"詩經韻讀","contributorLine":"现代 · 王力","publicationYear":1980,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"雄雉于飞，泄泄其羽。我之怀矣，自诒伊阻。雄雉于飞，下上其音。展矣君子，实劳我心。瞻彼日月，悠悠我思。道之云远，曷云能来。百尔君子，不知德行。不忮不求，何用不臧。","sourceLabel":"第 154-155 页","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","excerpt":"从页图可见，王力把《雄雉》每章视作独立韵段，前三章由鱼、侵、之三部递转，到末章转入阳部，声调上也配合由怀思转到规勉的收束。","fullText":"从页图可见，王力把《雄雉》每章视作独立韵段，前三章由鱼、侵、之三部递转，到末章转入阳部，声调上也配合由怀思转到规勉的收束。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-001","seg-002","seg-003","seg-004","seg-005","seg-006","seg-007","seg-008","seg-009","seg-010","seg-011","seg-012","seg-013","seg-014","seg-015","seg-016"]},{"id":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009:0001-1:part-1","annotationId":"0001","glossId":"0001-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009/0001-1","materialId":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009","materialTitle":"詩集傳","contributorLine":"宋 · 朱熹","publicationYear":1186,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"雄雉于飛。泄泄其羽。我之懷矣，自貽伊阻。","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null,"excerpt":"興也。朱熹以為婦人見雄雉飛行舒緩自得，而反興起對從役君子的思念；“自詒伊阻”則點出阻隔之苦，亦若其人自致遠役。","fullText":"興也。朱熹以為婦人見雄雉飛行舒緩自得，而反興起對從役君子的思念；“自詒伊阻”則點出阻隔之苦，亦若其人自致遠役。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-001","seg-002","seg-003","seg-004"]},{"id":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009:0002-1:part-1","annotationId":"0002","glossId":"0002-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009/0002-1","materialId":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009","materialTitle":"詩集傳","contributorLine":"宋 · 朱熹","publicationYear":1186,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"雄雉于飛。下上其音。展矣君子，實勞我心。","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null,"excerpt":"興也。朱熹說下上其音是雉飛鳴自得之狀，“展矣君子，實勞我心”則反覆加重所思君子勞我心之深。","fullText":"興也。朱熹說下上其音是雉飛鳴自得之狀，“展矣君子，實勞我心”則反覆加重所思君子勞我心之深。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-005","seg-006","seg-007","seg-008"]},{"id":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009:0003-1:part-1","annotationId":"0003","glossId":"0003-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009/0003-1","materialId":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009","materialTitle":"詩集傳","contributorLine":"宋 · 朱熹","publicationYear":1186,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"瞻彼日月，悠悠我思。道之云遠，曷云能來。","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null,"excerpt":"賦也。朱熹直以此章寫見日月往來而思君子從役之久，道路既遠，故不知何時能來。","fullText":"賦也。朱熹直以此章寫見日月往來而思君子從役之久，道路既遠，故不知何時能來。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-009","seg-010","seg-011","seg-012"]},{"id":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009:0004-1:part-1","annotationId":"0004","glossId":"0004-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009/0004-1","materialId":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009","materialTitle":"詩集傳","contributorLine":"宋 · 朱熹","publicationYear":1186,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"百爾君子，不知德行。不忮不求，何用不臧。","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null,"excerpt":"賦也。朱熹解“百”為凡，認為此章是憂其遠行之犯患，而冀其善處得全；只要不忮害、不貪求，則無往而不善。","fullText":"賦也。朱熹解“百”為凡，認為此章是憂其遠行之犯患，而冀其善處得全；只要不忮害、不貪求，則無往而不善。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":["seg-013","seg-014","seg-015","seg-016"]},{"id":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009:0005-1:part-1","annotationId":"0005","glossId":"0005-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/033-xiong-zhi/zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009/0005-1","materialId":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009","materialTitle":"詩集傳","contributorLine":"宋 · 朱熹","publicationYear":1186,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"雄雉四章章四句","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null,"excerpt":"朱熹记《雄雉》为四章、章四句，并通篇视作婦人念夫從役于外之辭。","fullText":"朱熹记《雄雉》为四章、章四句，并通篇视作婦人念夫從役于外之辭。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":[]}]}}}
